P2255R2 __reference_converts_from_temporary (N5008 [meta.rel],
[dcl.init.ref]/5.4): binding `const int&` to an int prvalue
materializes a temporary (true); a non-const lvalue reference cannot
bind a temporary (false).  Previously both evaluated false
(conservative default), skewing libstdc++-13's dangling-reference
SFINAE (__is_invocable_impl / _Callable chains).
